{{!--
Contagion Check card body — the *Check half of contagion. Anyone may post it;
it OFFERS a Contagion Test to the target's controller and changes nothing. The
appended [Contagion Test] button (added by buildActionCard) makes the roll.
Body only — no buttons here.
--}}
<div class="sohl chat-card">
    <header class="card-header flexrow">
        <h3 class="title">{{localize "SOHL.Chat.ContagionCheck.title"}}</h3>
    </header>

    <div class="card-content center">
        <span>{{localize "SOHL.Chat.ContagionCheck.exposed" target=targetName}}</span>
    </div>
</div>
